## Installation

<InstallCommand pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui" shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/button.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Button } from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/button";
</script>

<Button>Button</Button>
```

## Link

Pass `href` to render a semantic link with the same styles.

```svelte
<Button href="/login">Login</Button>
```

## API Reference

### Button

`Button` supports the COSS `variant`, `size`, and `loading` props. Native button attributes pass to
the underlying element. When `loading` is true, the component keeps its width, adds
`data-loading`, sets `aria-disabled`, and disables interaction while the loading indicator is shown.
Use `href`, `target`, `rel`, and `download` for links. Use `as` only for non-link polymorphic button
semantics.

See the [Shards Button API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/button) for keyboard and disabled behavior.

